OL,3,GNEWSAGroup searches for new Constables
OL,4,Aand Douzeniers
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn event has been organised for any
OL,7,Fislanders interested in potentially
OL,8,Fbecoming a Constable or a Douzenier.
OL,10,FThe Douzaine Liaison Group, an informal
OL,11,Fsub-group of the Policy & Resources
OL,12,FCommittee, has arranged an open morning
OL,13,Fon Saturday between 10:00 BST and 12:00
OL,14,Fat the Beau Sejour Centre in Amherst.
OL,16,FThe group said ahead of the upcoming
OL,17,FParish elections across Guernsey on 4
OL,18,FNovember, there were Constable
OL,19,Fopportunities and more than 30
OL,20,Fopportunities to become a Douzenier.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
