OL,3,GNEWSAGroup searches for new Constables
OL,4,Aand Douzeniers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouzeniers and Constables undertake a
OL,7,Fwide range of administrative and
OL,8,Fpractical responsibilities, from
OL,9,Fattending monthly meetings to dealing
OL,10,Fwith parish matters.
